 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "hook1",
   "text": "You've found it. The perfect parking space. Right by the kerb.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "hook2",
   "text": "But the kerb just yawned. It's a sleeping crocodile. What do you do?",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong1",
   "text": "Most drivers just reverse in, and bump the kerb.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong2",
   "text": "Big mistake. The kerb wakes up. And it's hungry. Snap! There goes your bumper. Crunch! There goes a wheel.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong3",
   "text": "Then it swallows the whole car, like a sandwich. Burp. All that's left: your number plate. And you, holding the steering wheel.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong4",
   "text": "Exam failed.",
   "gap": 1.15
  },
  {
   "id": "right1",
   "text": "Here's how you do it properly.",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "right2",
   "text": "Stop, before you touch the kerb. Never wake a sleeping crocodile.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right3",
   "text": "Instead, tuck it in with a blanket, and play a lullaby on the radio.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right4",
   "text": "Now it dreams so sweetly, it curls up like a kitten, and leaves you the whole space.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right5",
   "text": "Reverse in, gently. Not a single bump. Then hang up a sign: do not disturb.",
   "gap": 0.6
  },
  {
   "id": "right6",
   "text": "Crocodile: still asleep.",
   "gap": 0.6
  },
  {
   "id": "right7",
   "text": "Exam passed.",
   "gap": 1.3
  },
  {
   "id": "outro",
   "text": "Next exam question: the roadworks man is a parrot. Follow, so you don't miss it.",
   "gap": 1.2
  }
 ],
